      "name": "Blood Tendril Lash",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "free"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Whenever an enemy ends it turn within the reach of one or more tendrils, the tendril lashes out at them, dealing @Damage[(1 + floor((max(@actor.flags.pf2e-summons-assistant.rank, 3) - 3) / 3))d12[bludgeoning]] damage with a @Check[reflex|basic|dc:resolve(@actor.flags.pf2e-summons-assistant.dc)] save.</p><hr><p><strong>Heightened (+3)</strong> The number of thralls this spell can create increases by 1, and the damage increases by [[/r 1d12]].</p>",
